; Machine mode that is selected when the machine starts.
; This file remembers it: the mode buttons of the pages change it, and automodeselect.g reads it at start-up.
; You normally do not edit this file by hand. Valid values: "FFF" (3D printer), "Laser" or "CNC".
; If your machine only has one head, leave it as it is, or put the mode you have.
global selectedMode = "FFF"
